cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this manuscript when using its results or supporting code."
title: "Understanding Nondeterminism: Faster SAT and Exact Counting for Small Circuits"
authors:
  - family-names: Schlesinger
    given-names: Samuel
repository-code: "https://github.com/SamuelSchlesinger/understanding-nondeterminism"
url: "https://github.com/SamuelSchlesinger/understanding-nondeterminism/blob/main/main.pdf"
date-released: 2026-09-05
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  An AI-assisted research manuscript deriving an exponential-space SAT and exact
  counting algorithm for B2 circuits, with an exponential saving over exhaustive
  search below four gates per input at any fixed positive gap. Also develops
  existential-projection circuit bounds and witness-coverage results. Historical
  priority of the precise combined bounds remains unestablished.
